Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 08:50:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] Keep the spend count when a join request replaces the
 dead

approve_investigator retired the dead predecessor but left the new
investigator at 0 spends used. It now takes the larger count of the
dead predecessors still active, as rejoin does. FAQ.md, ROUTES.md and
QUIRKS.md say so.

Checked with a new test in test_campaigns.py (failing before) and the
whole of test_campaigns.py passing.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WaLz6UBTQ5XaTKSYwqeMKA
